f80bf3cbf9b7728b2c6894086a3b017ed264ead627a92f0adf9abe342b446e313dab339f\" conalt=\"5\" alt=\"5\" title=\"5\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><source src=\"https://dcimg5.dcinside.com/dccon.php?no=62b5df2be09d3ca567b1c5bc12d46b394aa3b1058c6e4d0ca41648b658e92c73d0c0fc4013acf80bf3cbf9b7728b2c6894086a3b017ed264ead627a92f0adf9abe342b446e313dab339fdcf4b712\" type=\"video/mp4\" onerror=\"change_gif(this)\"></video></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><font size=\"3\">이게 끝임.</font></p><p><font size=\"3\">정말 별 거 없음</font></p><p><font size=\"3\">9단 진입이 43초 언저리여야 가능성 있으니 참고 바람</font></p><p><font size=\"3\"><br></font></p><p><span style=\"font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg4.dcinside.co.kr/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce784fa1bd62531e1d35755bb65e98af887221655b5272a09a011bff044b92c9b7a45a105f29248f349564b70ec0515b119b72a160c25\" data-tempno=\"198129434\" alt=\"viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce784fa1bd62531e1d35755bb65e98af887221655b5272a09a011bff044b92c9b7a45a105f29248f349564b70ec0515b119b72a160c25\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">이건 오늘 클리어한 사진인거삼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">보시다시피 흑련이 리버보다 1.4배 정도 쎄고</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">나유타가 2/3 리버 정도는 되기 때문에 메스트 안 써도 딜은 꽤 잘 나옴</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">그럼 모두 즐거운 문어 9단 잡이 할 수 있길 바람!!!!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br></span></p><p><video class=\"written_dccon \" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" onmousedown=\"mp4_overlay_dccon(this, 'https://dcimg5.dcinside.com/dccon.php?no=62b5df2be09d3ca567b1c5bc12d46b394aa3b1058c6e4d0ca41648b658e82c717a6e96cbce4e9be71a8a96c3bf3f822d495fb3d177cbab8893e844fd9d9815b37fcb7c50bbc03effca',' conalt=2 alt=2 title=2');\" data-src=\"https://dcimg5.dcinside.com/dccon.p